 allows are proving disruptive to our efforts to safeguard good governance within the firm.&nbsp; We are, therefore, minded to put you on
paid leave for the remainder of your notice period.&nbsp; We would view that as regrettable since we are in the midst of the PDD Trial and would much prefer to have you remain
working on the team.&nbsp; However, your continued conduct threatens to seriously damage morale and be more disruptive than helpful, taking account of the best interests of our clients.
