 confirm how we should proceed in notifying Willis of these claims before we put any offer out to the D’s&nbsp;Tom &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Tom&nbsp;CrowGroup&nbsp;Financial&nbsp;Controller+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7890&nbsp;043&nbsp;708From: Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt; Sent: 03 October 2025 17:08To: Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Emissions Case Leads &lt;EmissionsCaseLeads@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject: Re: Pan NOx Notification&nbsp;As discussed, and now with PCD included, draft below and document attached&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hi James,&nbsp;Understood thanks. To update, we now have the costs from PCD as well (circulated at 2pm today).&nbsp;&nbsp;For ease, the numbers are in the attached sheet.&nbsp;Total approval across all 5 cases being sought at 80% of costs, is £687,132.90.&nbsp;Thanks,&nbsp;PG&nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Michael&nbsp;Burke(He/Him)Partner+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7960&nbsp;032&nbsp;34407960&nbsp;032&nbsp;344From:&nbsp;James Burke &lt;james.burke2@wtwco.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;Friday, October 03, 2025 3:43 PMTo:&nbsp;Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Jonathan Simon &lt;Jonathan.Simon@wtwco.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Emissions Case Leads &lt;EmissionsCaseLeads@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Pan NOx Notification &nbsp;CAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.&nbsp;Yes of course. Unfortunately we are aware that the lead underwriter at Ignite is currently travelling (on a plane at the moment) which may delay the response. We have asked all insurers for a response as soon as possible.&nbsp;James Burke&nbsp;Associate Director (Solicitor)Litigation and Contingent Risk FI