 appreciate your prompt response as Leigh Day is pressing us to execute these as soon as possible.Kind regards,​​​​Dilan&nbsp;AlmaAssociate&nbsp;(General&nbsp;Counsel)From:&nbsp;Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;22 September 2025 09:06To:&nbsp;Dilan Alma &lt;dalma@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Carolina Koschdoski de Souza &lt;csouza@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Donatas Juskauskas &lt;djuskauskas@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Instruction of new counsel on NOx&nbsp;Yes please thanks Dilan&nbsp;This will not be contentious and is in line with the other Nox CFA’s so we can probably keep it brief&nbsp;Tom&nbsp;​​​​Tom&nbsp;CrowGroup&nbsp;Financial&nbsp;Controller+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7890&nbsp;043&nbsp;708From:&nbsp;Dilan Alma &lt;dalma@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;19 September 2025 19:33To:&nbsp;Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Carolina Koschdoski de Souza &lt;csouza@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Donatas Juskauskas &lt;djuskauskas@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;Re: Instruction of new counsel on NOx&nbsp;Hi Tom,&nbsp;Sorry for the late response. I will summarise the economic terms and draft a note for Gramercy and we can share with the CFA drafts, but we may need to do some work on the overall impact with you and DJ for the note. Happy to speak on Monday.&nbsp;Have a good weekend.&nbsp;Thanks.&nbsp;Dilan​​​​Dilan&nbsp;AlmaAssociate&nbsp;(General&nbsp;Counsel)From:&nbsp;Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;18 September 2025 16:32To:&nbsp;Dilan Alma &lt;dalma@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Carolina Koschdoski de Souza &lt;csouza@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Donatas Juskauskas &lt;djuskauskas@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;FW: Instruction of new counsel on NOx&nbsp;Hey Dilan&nbsp;What is the process for getting G consent for third party fees?&nbsp;Tom&nbsp;​​​​Tom&nbsp;CrowGroup&nbsp;Financial&nbsp;Controller+44&n