 agreement. These concerns were evidently ignored (including our concerns over the mental health and well-being of the staff) given it was executed without further recourse to us. &nbsp;It also remains unclear what, if any, interaction LD is to have with the wider
 PG team, if they are not subject to the AA (and therefore direction and supervision), and whether, given this, the PG team would need to revert to one of the Case Leads for every interaction, instruction, discussion had with the LD team. An obvious example
